			)
		)
		(property "Description" "16-bit FRAM MCU, 4 KB program + 512 B info FRAM, 512 B RAM. LCD_E: up to 4x36 or 8x32 segments, any of L0-L39 software-assignable as COM or SEG, charge pump keeps the LCD on in LPM3.5 (0.94 uA typ at 3 V). Charge pump needs 0.1 uF LCDCAP0-LCDCAP1 and 0.1 uF on each of R13/R23/R33. 10-bit ADC, eUSCI_A0 (UART/SPI) + eUSCI_B0 (SPI/I2C), two Timer_A3, RTC counter, single DVCC (4.7-10 uF + 100 nF), RST 47 k pull-up with <= 1.1 nF for Spy-Bi-Wire. LQFP-64 (PM); FR4131/FR4132/FR4133 share the pinout and match the MSP-EXP430FR4133 LaunchPad. Functions are pin alternates."
			(at 85.09 125.73 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
